    "raw": "Design an Operational Transconductance Amplifier (OTA) in GF180MCU with ports VDD VSS INP INN OUT IBIAS where IBIAS is an external bias current input. VDD=3.3 V, VSS=0 V, VIN_CM=1.65 V, CL=5 pF, 27 C. DC gain >= 35 dB, GBW >= 1 MHz, phase margin >= 60 deg, rising and falling slew rate >= 0.5 V/us, supply current (excluding IBIAS) <= 250 uA, output DC at zero differential input = 1.65 V +/- 0.5 V, usable output swing >= 0.5-2.8 V. Also characterize CMRR, PSRR, input common-mode range, power, noise and offset, and check PVT corners (VDD 3.0/3.3/3.6 V, temp -40/27/125 C, gf180 typical/ff/ss).",
